        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also continue to evolve the way we package and sell our offerings to provide high quality and value combined with flexibility to meet the unique needs of our existing and prospective customers.",
        "start_character": 16754,
        "end_character": 16950
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are developing and implementing AI features in certain of our solutions and services as a key element of our strategy to enhance customer workflows, improve operational efficiency and support decision-making, while maintaining appropriate human oversight and governance controls.",
        "start_character": 20830,
        "end_character": 21112
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we compete successfully against these competitors through a combination of our integrated suite of offerings and nationwide community networks within verticals where we compete, offering solutions with market leading robustness and reporting as well as the scale, reach, and reputation of our organization.",
        "start_character": 47585,
        "end_character": 47902
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we compete successfully against these traditional fundraising service providers, primarily because our solutions and services are more automated, more robust, more tailored to the needs of nonprofit organizations and more efficient.",
        "start_character": 50513,
        "end_character": 50756
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At bbcon®, our annual user conference in October 2025, we launched Agents for Good™, our agentic AI suite, designed to augment customer teams with virtual AI-driven assistants capable of autonomously executing complex workflows across fundraising, finance and corporate impact functions.",
        "start_character": 6448,
        "end_character": 6735
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Blackbaud is an exceptional place to work because we combine purpose, flexibility and innovation to attract, develop and retain top talent.",
        "start_character": 58731,
        "end_character": 58870
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we regularly monitor new regulatory developments in applicable jurisdictions in order to identify and mitigate ethical and legal issues presented by our use of AI.",
        "start_character": 22494,
        "end_character": 22670
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In our over 40 years of operation, we have gained significant insight into the overall market and industry segments in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 18379,
        "end_character": 18515
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our commitment to new and emerging AI technologies requires that we invest in the development and maintenance of various models, approaches and processes, as well as the development of protections and safeguards for the use of AI technologies and requires that we hire persons with specialized expertise.",
        "start_character": 22910,
        "end_character": 23214
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001280058-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001280058-26-000006-f964cef52e9567be",
        "accession_number": "0001280058-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also deploying AI-enabled tools across our internal operations, including research and development, customer operations and general and administrative functions, to automate routine activities, accelerate workflows and support internal productivity, while maintaining appropriate controls and governance.",
